IT's the 2nd  best pure damage weapon after Grayswandir, and given the
searching ability many would argue it's the best overall artifact
weapon (though Grayswandir, Sceptre of Might, and  Magicbane also have
strong proponents, and a few like the Staff).  Snickersnee is also
quite good.

There are some others (particularly Mjollnir) that are better early on
but become nearly useless in the late game, and others (Frosty and
Firebrand) that do better damage against some things but much worse
against others (and the "others" tend to be later game, which makes
those 2 less desirable).  All 3 of those also have the disadvantage of
blowing up inventory of some sort.


